+ * and it parses them in `PARSE_LINES_PER_CHUNK`-line chunks with an event-loop
+ * turn between chunks. Without both, a tick read and parsed everything appended
+ * since the last one — unbounded on a long replay, and enough to hold the main
+ * thread off the event loop for as long as the log had grown.
